OL,3,AProblems at health trust buildings
OL,4,Acould cost additional #20m
OL,5,
OL,6,FProblems at two Belfast Health and
OL,7,FSocial Care Trust buildings could
OL,8,Famount to almost #20m in additional
OL,9,Fcosts, the BBC has learned.
OL,11,FNewly-discovered issues with the
OL,12,FBelfast maternity hospital could add
OL,13,Falmost #10m to the project's spiralling
OL,14,Fcosts, while the amount spent on
OL,15,Frepairs and rehousing patients at the
OL,16,FAcute Mental Health facility has now
OL,17,Freached #9.4m.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
