OL,3,AProblems at health trust buildings
OL,4,Acould cost additional #20m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe maternity building on the Royal
OL,7,FVictoria Hospital (RVH) site is already
OL,8,Ftens of millions of pounds over budget
OL,9,Fand more than a decade behind schedule.
OL,10,FThe new costs mean the project will
OL,11,Fexceed #100m.
OL,13,FThe Department of Health, which
OL,14,Fprovides funding to the trust, has been
OL,15,Fapproached for comment by BBC News NI.
